WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.206
Create your first world. Describe the world, compare candidates, and build a Sketch.

2
00:00:03.206 --> 00:00:08.763
Choose Generate a new world, then Writing and world building.

3
00:00:08.763 --> 00:00:15.936
Describe the world in a few sentences.

4
00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:20.184
Review the recognised ideas. Apply all to use them in the brief.

5
00:00:20.184 --> 00:00:23.395
Find strong matches to compare possible starting worlds.

6
00:00:23.395 --> 00:00:28.600
Search time omitted. Compare the candidates and choose a favourite.

7
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:33.086
Continue to review your chosen seed.

8
00:00:33.086 --> 00:00:37.511
Continue to Build when the seed suits your world.

9
00:00:37.511 --> 00:00:41.783
Choose Sketch world for a quick first pass.

10
00:00:41.783 --> 00:00:46.006
Start the build. The app simulates the world in the background.

11
00:00:46.006 --> 00:00:53.542
Build time omitted. Choose Open in studio to explore your world.
